      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. everyone in my department just... they all stopped talking to me. like i'm a ghost. i walk into the lounge and the air just goes cold and everyone looks away. it's not even like they're mad anymore, they're just done with me. it's like i was erased. i don't know how i'm supposed to keep doing this every single day when i'm basically already dead to everyone.",
