      "content": "talking to them? they're the ones who did this. there's no \"getting help\" from the people who decided you don't matter. i try to tell myself it's just a phase or whatever, but it feels so permanent. like there's no version of my life where this doesn't follow me. it's just this huge, empty void where my whole life used to be.",
