      "content": "it's just... it's exhausting. the \"coping\" and the \"talking\" it all feels so fake when you're actually living it. you're just walking through a world where you've been deleted. everything is just a reminder that i'm a mistake. i honestly feel like i'm just waiting for something to end because it's too much to carry. there's no point in \"exploring\" a life that feels this broken.",
